REGENT OF WEST SOUTHEAST MALUKU
MALUKU PROVINCE
REGIONAL REGULATION
OF WEST SOUTHEAST MALUKU REGENCY
NUMBER 04 YEAR 2017
CONCERNING
THE IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION
FOR WOMEN AND CHILD VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
THE REGENT OF WEST SOUTHEAST MALUKU,

Considering: a. that as citizens, women and children have the right to obtain protection from any acts of violence committed against them that may cause physical or psychological harm, as part of the recognition and enforcement of Human Rights;
b. that the number of acts of violence against women and children in West Southeast Maluku Regency is quite high, while protection and services have not been carried out optimally;
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Implementation of Protection for Women and Child Victims of Violence.

In View of: 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 4 Year 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1979, Number 32, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3143);
3. Law Number 7 Year 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (Convention On The Elimination Of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984, Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3668);
5. Law Number 39 Year 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
6. Law Number 46 Year 1999 concerning the Establishment of North Maluku Province, Buru Regency and West Southeast Maluku Regency (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 175, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3895); as amended by Law Number 06 Year 2000 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2000 Number 75, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3961);
•
7. Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235);
8. Law Number 17 Year 2003 concerning State Finance (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2003 Number 47, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4286);
9. Law Number 23 year 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);
10. Law Number 33 Year 2004 concerning Financial Balance Between the Central Government and Regional Governments (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 126, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4438);
11. Law Number 21 Year 2007 concerning the Eradication of the Criminal Act of Human Trafficking (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007, Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4720);
12. Law Number 12 Year 2011 concerning the Formulation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2011 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235);
13. Law Number 23 Year 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587);
14. Government Regulation Number 25 Year 2000 concerning the Authority of the Government and the Authority of the Province as an Autonomous Region (State Gazette Year 2000 Number 54, Supplement to the State Gazette Number 3952);
15. Government Regulation Number 38 Year 2007 concerning the Division of Government Affairs Between the Government, Provincial Regional Government and Regency/City Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4737);
16. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 2 Year 2008 concerning the Implementation of Women's Protection;
17. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 3 Year 2008 concerning the Implementation of Child Protection;
